# Keep Railway/Docker build contexts small and reproducible.
# Build context is the repo root for every service (the front-ends import
# ../../packages/protocol), so this lives at the root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vite
.git
.github
**/*.log
# docs / local tooling never belong in an image
docs
.claude
